  "interpretation": "The hippo misannotation results that survive are comparative (scLDL > kNN; similar harder than uniform; entropy unused). The absolute discovery/correction numbers do not transfer to a Slide-seqV2 lymph-node puck where identity itself is weak. Label-noise recovery is gated by whether the types are linearly/PCA-separable, not by a general noise-robustness property of the evidential head."
